{
  // buildTime: ticks a vehicle garage takes to produce it.
  // Vehicles leave the yard empty and need a driver to move or fire. crew:
  // who may drive, how close they must walk to climb in (tenths of a cell),
  // the percent chance the driver survives the vehicle's destruction, and
  // the percent of max HP a surviving driver loses bailing out. passengers: seats in the back
  // for units with one of passengerTags (they ride, they can't fire out, and they bail out of a
  // destroyed vehicle by the same survival and exitDamage rules as the driver).
