    {
      // The mobile radar (docs/design.md, "Mobile radar"; an SA-6 "Straight Flush" type, the 1S91 of the 2K12 Kub): a light
      // tracked chassis with a tall drum carrying the flat surveillance antenna and the round tracking dish. It must stop and
      // set up to search (Deploy: 8 s, the drum rises and the antennas start turning; it packs up in 6 s): set up, it tracks
      // the air out to 400 cells (airVision, slant from its antenna 7 m up, by each target's signature) for its side: the
      // team cueing lets the AA soldiers and the air defence vehicles pick and lock what it tracks within their own weapon's
      // range, and the side sees those aircraft under fog. Packed up or moving it has only its ordinary sight. Its ground air
      // defence locks about 30% faster on what it tracks (cueLock 70: 70% of their own lock time); never more range. No
      // weapon, no ground radar. Its surveillance antenna turns once every 4 s (sweepTicks, for renderers). Medium armour, 280 HP; speed 30, the air defence vehicle's (it keeps up with the column).
      // From the vehicle garage (40 s, 1600). Placeholder numbers. Its tag air_radar: an air radar the stealth multirole's radar
      // spotting reveals (the SA-6 launcher's radar: the launcher has no radar of its own).
      "id": "mobile_radar", "crusher": 2, "name": "Mobile radar", "glyph": "w", "tags": ["vehicle", "radar", "air_radar"], "tunnelSize": 2, "tunnelSlots": 5,
      "locomotor": "tracked", "armor": "medium_vehicle", "height": 70, "hp": 280, "speed": 30, "radius": 10, "turnRate": 2,
      "deployTicks": 160, "stowTicks": 120,
      "vision": 60, "airVision": 4000, "cueLock": 70, "sweepTicks": 80, "buildTime": 800, "cost": 1600,
      "crew": { "tags": ["soldier"], "enterRange": 15, "survival": 50, "exitDamage": 40 }
    },
    {
      // The SA-6 launcher (docs/design.md, "SA-6 launcher"; a 2K12 Kub type, the 2P25): the mobile radar's tracked chassis
