      // medium armour; speed 30 (the radar's). From the vehicle garage (45 s, 1800 + 200 for the missiles = 2000). It
      // reloads only at a supply depot, packed up, one missile at a time. Placeholder numbers.
      "id": "kub_launcher", "crusher": 2, "name": "SA-6 launcher", "glyph": "k", "tags": ["vehicle"], "tunnelSize": 2, "tunnelSlots": 5,
      "locomotor": "tracked", "armor": "medium_vehicle", "hp": 280, "speed": 30, "radius": 10, "turnRate": 2, "turret": true,
      "deployTicks": 100, "stowTicks": 80,
      "vision": 60, "buildTime": 900, "cost": 1800, "components": ["kub_missiles"],
      "crew": { "tags": ["soldier"], "enterRange": 15, "survival": 50, "exitDamage": 40 }
    },
    {
      // The S-400 type radar (docs/design.md, "S-400 type air defence"; the owner's spec of 2026-10-27, starting values to tune):
      // a big flat array on a mast raised over an 8x8 truck, the battery's eyes. It searches only set up (30 s; packs up in 20 s;
      // any move packs it up first): air search 800 cells of slant from its antenna 25 m up, by each target's signature, its
      // array turning once every 4 s. Counter-stealth 50: to it every signature value moves halfway to 100 (the stealth bomber's
      // detect 25 counts as 62: seen out to about 500 cells, not 200). Radar horizon: beyond 200 cells it does not see a target
      // lower than 50 m whose line from the antenna the ground cuts. Its tracks are its side's (team cueing) and its cue cuts a
      // friendly shooter's lock to 70%. Emitter: while it searches, every enemy unit with an air or ground radar within 800 cells
      // of it sees where it is (a 2-cell disc, renewed each sweep, 10 s after); the Hide stance switches it off (and blinds the
      // battery). The launchers (s400_launcher) within 100 cells fire on what it tracks. Tag s400_radar: the launchers' battery
      // link; air_radar: the stealth multirole's radar spotting reveals it. Not "radar": the SA-6 launcher does not link to it.
      // 320 HP, medium armour, speed 25 (2.5 cells/s); from the vehicle garage, 60 s, 3,000.
      "id": "s400_radar", "crusher": 2, "name": "Long-range radar", "glyph": "w", "tags": ["vehicle", "heavy", "s400_radar", "air_radar"], "tunnelSize": 3, "tunnelSlots": 8,
